# ===== MFAI Monorepo .gitignore (Optimized for Zenflow) =====

# --- 1. Logs & Runtime ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
logs/
*.pid
nohup.out
backend.log

# --- 2. Zenflow & AI Context (CRITICAL) ---
# Le "Cerveau" local ne doit pas être commité pour éviter les conflits entre dévs
.zenflow_context.md
# On ignore les dossiers de travail temporaires des agents (sauf les workflows)
.antigravity/
.serena/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.gemini/

# --- 3. Data & Storage (CRITICAL) ---
# Protection absolue de la base de données locale
data/
**/dev.db
**/*.sqlite
prisma/dev.db
prisma/*.db
backups/
dump/
tmp/

# --- 4. Environment & Secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
.secrets-backup/
web/minter.json

# --- 5. Node / Build / Dependencies ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
.next_trash/
.nyc_output/
.cache/
.turbo/

# --- 6. Tests & Coverage ---
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
artifacts/
cypress/videos/
cypress/screenshots/
*.trace
trace.zip
video.webm

# --- 7. Debug Reports & Temporary Files ---
suprem_audit_*.txt
routes_visited*.txt
e2e_json_counts*.txt
sha256.txt
zero_byte_files.txt
list_tests.txt
mf-back/memory/agent_metrics.log.json
qa-report.md
task.md
**/qa-report.md
**/task.md
**/*qa_report*
**/*task_*
**/*phase*_execution*.log
**/*files_list*.log

# --- 8. IDE & System ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tar.gz
*.tar
*.bak
.zenflow/
